1:["$","main",null,{"className":"site article-page","children":[["$","$Le",null,{}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-frame","children":[["$","a",null,{"className":"desktop-brand","href":"/","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"letter-cascade is-in","aria-label":"thinking.haus","children":[["$","b","t-0",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":0},"children":"t"}],["$","b","h-1",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":1},"children":"h"}],["$","b","i-2",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":2},"children":"i"}],["$","b","n-3",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":3},"children":"n"}],["$","b","k-4",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":4},"children":"k"}],["$","b","i-5",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":5},"children":"i"}],["$","b","n-6",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":6},"children":"n"}],["$","b","g-7",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":7},"children":"g"}],["$","b",".-8",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":8},"children":"."}],["$","b","h-9",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":9},"children":"h"}],["$","b","a-10",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":10},"children":"a"}],["$","b","u-11",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":11},"children":"u"}],["$","b","s-12",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":12},"children":"s"}]]}]}],["$","article",null,{"className":"article-column","data-content-slug":"a-system-for-looking","data-content-title":"A system for looking","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"A system for looking"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"August 5, 2026"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"3 minute read"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"author-edit-action","hidden":true,"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"https://thinkinghaus-studio.maxpfennighaus.workers.dev/","children":"Edit"}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-body","children":[[["$","p","0-Before I make, I look.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["Before I make, I look."]}],["$","p","1-I used to confuse looking with collecting. I’d open a browser, save fifty images, and call the result research. My collection grew; my understanding did not.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["I used to confuse looking with collecting. I’d open a browser, save fifty images, and call the result research. My collection grew; my understanding did not."]}],["$","p","2-Now I try to begin with a question. What am I actually trying to understand? What has become so familiar that no one sees it anymore? What does a person need to know, feel, or do—and in what order? The question doesn’t need to point toward an answer. It only needs to give my looking a shape.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["Now I try to begin with a question. What am I actually trying to understand? What has become so familiar that no one sees it anymore? What does a person need to know, feel, or do—and in what order? The question doesn’t need to point toward an answer. It only needs to give my looking a shape."]}],["$","p","3-I start near the subject. If I’m working on a corporate report, I look at reports. I need to understand the form before I decide what to do with it.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["I start near the subject. If I’m working on a corporate report, I look at reports. I need to understand the form before I decide what to do with it."]}],["$","p","4-Then I move farther away. I might look at newspapers, maps, instruction manuals, or paintings. A newspaper knows how to handle density. A map knows how to hold several scales at once. A painting may know something useful about directing the eye.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["Then I move farther away. I might look at newspapers, maps, instruction manuals, or paintings. A newspaper knows how to handle density. A map knows how to hold several scales at once. A painting may know something useful about directing the eye."]}],"$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14"],null,null]}],"$L15","$L16"]}]]}]]}]
17:I["0852856a0d0c",[],"Footer",1]
f:["$","p","5-I’m not looking for a style to borrow. I’m trying to notice what something is doing. When I save a reference, I write down why.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["I’m not looking for a style to borrow. I’m trying to notice what something is doing. When I save a reference, I write down why."]}]
10:["$","p","6-The note is at least as useful as the image. It gives me enough distance to carry the idea somewhere else without copying its appearance.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["The note is at least as useful as the image. It gives me enough distance to carry the idea somewhere else without copying its appearance."]}]
11:["$","p","7-Then I arrange what I’ve found and start removing things. One reference tells me what I like. Several references placed together begin to reveal what I think. The one that doesn’t fit is often worth keeping around. Or it may be pointing to something the rest of the collection has politely avoided.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["Then I arrange what I’ve found and start removing things. One reference tells me what I like. Several references placed together begin to reveal what I think. The one that doesn’t fit is often worth keeping around. Or it may be pointing to something the rest of the collection has politely avoided."]}]
12:["$","p","8-Time helps too. I’m easily persuaded by novelty and veneer. If I leave the references alone for a day, some become less convincing; a few become more interesting.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["Time helps too. I’m easily persuaded by novelty and veneer. If I leave the references alone for a day, some become less convincing; a few become more interesting."]}]
13:["$","p","9-Eventually, I make something, usually before I feel ready. A rough sketch shows whether an observation can survive contact with actual words, scale, and use. If it can’t, no matter how cute it is, it gets tossed off the cliff.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["Eventually, I make something, usually before I feel ready. A rough sketch shows whether an observation can survive contact with actual words, scale, and use. If it can’t, no matter how cute it is, it gets tossed off the cliff."]}]
14:["$","p","10-So my system isn’t very complicated: begin with a question, look outside the category, name what matters, arrange, remove, make, and look again. The point is not to build an impressive moodboard. It’s to notice enough that a decision becomes easier.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["So my system isn’t very complicated: begin with a question, look outside the category, name what matters, arrange, remove, make, and look again. The point is not to build an impressive moodboard. It’s to notice enough that a decision becomes easier."]}]
